{
  "comment": "Machines of the test matrix. kind: local (the host itself), docker (the host's kernel, another C library), vm (its own kernel; a KVM guest from an official cloud image). VM images are pinned by sha256 of the file (Debian publishes SHA512SUMS only: sha512 is the publisher's, sha256 was computed from the verified file); containers by the registry's manifest digest. user is the cloud image's default user, which cloud-init gives the generated key. expect is what the machine should report.",
